00:24:38.930 --> 00:24:40.240
go find one of the Goons.

00:24:40.240 --> 00:24:41.930
They were these like red shirts.

00:24:41.930 --> 00:24:44.210
And they will help you
navigate the conference

00:24:44.210 --> 00:24:46.407
and take care of whatever
