00:24:46.407 --> 00:24:47.990
I would say go to
some of the villages

00:24:47.990 --> 00:24:49.589
and find people
who are like-minded

00:24:49.589 --> 00:24:51.130
and find things
you're excited about.

00:24:51.130 --> 00:24:52.610
If you're new, the
Lockpick Village

00:24:52.610 --> 00:24:53.830
is a great place to
just go hang out.

00:24:53.830 --> 00:24:55.550
There's a bunch of tables
with locks you can pick.

00:24:55.550 --> 00:24:56.830
MELANIE WARRICK: It sounds fun.

00:24:56.830 --> 00:24:57.913
MAYA KACZOROWSKI: Exactly.

00:24:57.913 --> 00:25:00.387
And all the big rooms, all
those talks are recorded.

00:25:00.387 --> 00:25:02.720
So if you miss one of those,
it's not really a big deal.

00:25:02.720 --> 00:25:04.345
The stuff that's in
person is the stuff

00:25:04.345 --> 00:25:06.200
that you're going
to really miss.

00:25:06.200 --> 00:25:06.350
MARK MANDEL: Fantastic.

00:25:06.350 --> 00:25:07.700
MELANIE WARRICK: It sounds about
right for most conferences.

00:25:07.700 --> 00:25:08.570
MAYA KACZOROWSKI: Exactly.

00:25:08.570 --> 00:25:09.230
MELANIE WARRICK: Well, great.

