some of the partners

00:25:26.120 --> 00:25:29.060
that we announced in that
space; one on isolation.

00:25:29.060 --> 00:25:30.320
Just so many blog posts.

00:25:30.320 --> 00:25:31.770
MELANIE WARRICK: That's a
